{"synopsis":"Kombinasi paling orisinal dalam sejarah—darah manusia dan ogre bersatu!” ‘Leon’ blasteran, lahir dari perpaduan manusia dan ogre. Namun, yang kembali padanya sebagai blasteran hanyalah eksploitasi dan pengkhianatan manusia. Leon membenci manusia seperti itu dan bersumpah untuk membalas dendam. Bagi Leon, yang selalu menderita karena kekurangan kekuatan, keberuntungan datang memanggil, dan ia diberi kesempatan untuk membalas dendam pada manusia.","alternative_title":"하프 블러드","author":"Bangyo, Kim Jeong-Ryul","artist":"Studio A.H.A","chapters":[{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"38ba5f3a-4461-4e3b-9b05-21f1a3504fa6","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"3a16b888-9e6f-4378-bddb-60832525255d","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"5873bfaf-df2c-4694-a464-f8bc48bb8f5b","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-06-26"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"4229799e-80cb-46b0-aa36-03d4aab0f4aa","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-06-17"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"aee5cc4c-7f53-4ada-9cf5-2530b33f07fa","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-06-17"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"cbd72fe0-13b6-44b9-b796-9228db394bb4","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-05-25"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"318748aa-9033-4d49-8e57-8d6054f2191d","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"13f0f018-6eef-4a2a-b242-3605a5af8fe6","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"22be61e5-c075-4c12-a9d6-e6adc5a771ce","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-05-04"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"1cc022a1-c1ea-43be-bea9-2182406a2846","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-05-04"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"c914836d-8c74-4e5b-a33f-1a76f3b9e541","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-04-11"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"0a4505f4-f54c-4aeb-afd4-a11dbcb3a513","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-04-04"},{"number":"42","chapte